; =====================================================================
; Concussions_AttackHitVolumes.twk — decoded attack hit-volume data (GoW1)
; Source: part1.pak /TweakTemplates/Concussion/NNN instances (75 root strings,
;         24 unique templates; full-pak sweep 2026-08). Key names cracked
;         against SCUS_973.99 strings (node hash h*127+c).
; THE FINDING: the game's big-attack hit volumes are HAND-AUTHORED concussion
; spheres anchored at the CHARACTER ("zeroJoint"), decoupled from the blade
; model — confirming that gameplay hit registration is not the weapon sweep
; for impact moves. Radii are METERS (matches the Kratos≈2.0 m bridge).
; Each attack has a "C" (collision) and an "F" (FX visual ring) template.
; Blade-chain swings remain engine melee (no data — verified separately).
; ALL VALUES [real]. Attack association = the instance's own name string.
; =====================================================================

